Z||000000||Homicidal||09-01-2000||04:18 AM||||One was a nice but dirty dark green 85 GT, auto.  Needed a cleaning, BADLY, inside and out.  But overall paint and condition was nice.  <P>The second though, oh yah, a Cherry Red, waxed to the max 88 GT.  Totally mint, totally STOCK.  Just plain GORGEOUS.  Saw the owner in a store, so I dragged him to chat a bit.  He loves his car, it was his 3rd Fiero so far!<P>Just goes to show though, the difference in owners.  So many people take their little cars for granted because they heard so many horror (and myth) stories of our little cars, they offer no care for it.<P>But when an owner takes care of his Fiero, it sure catches eyes!  ||||reg||6
